Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:13.82,ED,,0,0,0,,你的笑容闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:18.82,ED,,0,0,0,,无论多远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:23.82,ED,,0,0,0,,多远的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:28.82,ED,,0,0,0,,我们都在迎接
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:34.82,ED,,0,0,0,,相同的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:39.52,ED,,0,0,0,,闪亮的 闪耀着的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:44.82,ED,,0,0,0,,回忆 维系上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:49.82,ED,,0,0,0,,未来的 未来的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:54.82,ED,,0,0,0,,神大人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:24:00.82,ED,,0,0,0,,神大人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛苦啊 茗子 明明想忘记 却不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,游的事 怎么也离不开脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不能成为回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛苦啊！（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不留下遗憾而努力 光希
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 茗子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了茗子我才鼓起勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,（蝉叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（发动机的异常声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（冲击音）（全体）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（发动机的异常声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…（游）光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 都想再和游说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,叫出租车（光希）不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在马上回日本 光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要！不跟游好好谈谈就不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,游没有 可是我有！在说完之前我不会回去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对…绝对不会回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,（殴打声）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（鸭子的叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心情都说了 为什么事到如今…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢游 光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经想忘记的 拼命努力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 还是不行…忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,忘不了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么喜欢游啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我全部记得游说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,「心情变冷了」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「不能像恋人那样看了」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 那种心情至今也没有改变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,今天……今天只是来传达我的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 光希 我们只能分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢游
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么游的心情突然变了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,改变了的东西是没办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我的心情不会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,即使想改变也改变不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢游…非常喜欢游！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我坦率的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…所以不能把游当做回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能继续喜欢着游
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不能对自己说谎活下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,无论多么喜欢 彼此相爱 都是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能分手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们……我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是兄妹！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是兄妹啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了爸爸大学的毕业相册
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那里面夹着几张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在爸爸和妈妈的网球社团时代的照片中…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲和留美…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈和仁是情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有这样的事啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,父母们不是在夏威夷旅行中第一次见面的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,从大学的时候开始就和朋友一起情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在祖母的信里看到了我真正的父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈以前的恋人…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）讨厌…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是仁先生哟！你父亲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,游和我…是兄妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（鸟振翅的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你去机场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,（司机）到哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里都行 快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,即使被说「哪里都可以」…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,光希等着！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,曼哈顿…曼哈顿就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,（司机）OK
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,游和我…是兄妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,身高5英尺的日本女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,年龄17（警察）了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,游！怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还什么都…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有找到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-还没…-这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么？游
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,确实在上次收到的电话里 又开始和光希交往了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-算了吧 这是游私人问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我和光希是兄妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（3人）诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（男孩）哇~！嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）是列克星顿大街吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 在市立博物馆旁边 我马上过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱恩 去博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了像光希一样的女孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,（悲鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（队长）等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌啊哈哈！（队长）妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,（男性们）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（队长）恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哼…妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是光希
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她是中国人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,日本人和中国人很像所以很容易弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……去警署的遗体放置处看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你…光希…光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我没有恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而且曼哈顿是世界上最危险的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,确实啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望那个女孩没有误入后宫…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！（威尔）游！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,追上去 布莱恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,到这里就没事了 这是我们的秘密游乐场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（克里斯）呼啦呼啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 你们是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐是观光客吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你得小心些 观光客很容易被盯上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫光希
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是埃迪 这是克里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵……关系真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 因为我们是兄妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这一带很危险 我必须保护克里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是一样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥啊 真的很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,（2人）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,和我与游一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐？怎么了？好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,分开吧 我去这边找找！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我找这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,光希
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,光希
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 要没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？-嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才危险的时候明明没有哭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,（2人）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的关系真的很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊！我最喜欢哥哥了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…长大了就要嫁给哥哥了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 克里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能成为新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪也是？你要娶克里斯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 这不是理所当然的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,当然？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我最喜欢克里斯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们要一直 一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,（2人）是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 这不是理所当然的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我最喜欢克里斯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们要一直 一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（艾迪·克里斯）是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因为最喜欢了 所以要一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（悲鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃！啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（艾迪他们）恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,（队长）恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（队长）刚才你居然敢耍我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放开哥哥！放开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,放开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（殴打声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）游！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（打声）（游）哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（威尔他们）游！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,警察 这边！快过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕！切……可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了（光希）游…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不放开了…怎么能放开！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,游？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）「光希要是有个万一……」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,光是这样想的话 心好像要被撕裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,终于明白了 我不能离开光希
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一起活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再伪装自己的心了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是！我也和游想的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:22:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,和游…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:22:00.05,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,和光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一起活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然今后会一直有不安的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们需要彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么事 都要和游一起活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「橘子酱男孩」（光希・游）「踏上旅程」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「然后爱开始走」